  "description": "Japan's national research university. Its institution-operated machine-readable surface is library and digital-humanities infrastructure: two OAI-PMH 2.0 endpoints, IIIF Presentation 2.1 and Image 2.0 level2 services, DC-NDL item metadata in JSON-LD, an undocumented but live JSON records interface on the institutional repository, and three Shibboleth SAML 2.0 entities registered in the GakuNin federation. No general-purpose developer program, API key, OAuth server or course/registrar API is published.",
